        "description": {
            "value": "<p>A wave of gray mist formed of energy from the Void spills out from your outstretched hand, briefly taking the shape of a pack of predatory animals that set viciously on your foes. You deal 2d4 slashing damage and 2d4 void damage to creatures in the area, with a basic Fortitude save. The shades set upon the vulnerable with greater ferocity: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone] creatures or those taking persistent bleed damage take a –2 status penalty to the save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The slashing damage and the void damage each increase by 1d4.</p>"
